00:26:17.480 --> 00:26:20.450
Lorenzo Barisone: the Swiss Ledger blockchain.

147
00:26:20.450 --> 00:26:44.740
Lorenzo Barisone: For what concern, the, public sector applications, so especially, we have, two, public sector applications already, working on, Swiss Ledger. The first one is the Luga Municipal payment token. That is really the first, the first use case that, was born in the Swiss Ledger network.

148
00:26:44.740 --> 00:27:09.470
Lorenzo Barisone: So, it is really a project that is… that has aim of using the blockchain technology at the service of the local economy. And it is related to the application that is called My Lugano, and that can be downloaded from any app store available. So, what is the motivation behind

